---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import releases from "../../data/releases.json";
import config from "../../data/config.json";
const PROVIDERS = "ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Qwen";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Legal & Policies — TotalRecalls"
  description="Privacy Policy, Terms of Service, refund guidelines, and consumer rights for TotalRecalls Downloader and Smart Search Engine."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Legal" }]}
>

<div class="mb-6">
  <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-tr-amber block mb-2">Legal</span>
  <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Legal & Policies</h1>
  <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Version {config.version} · Last updated {config.lastUpdated}</p>
</div>

<div class="space-y-10 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground border-t border-border/60 pt-8">

  {/* Section 1: Privacy Policy — summary */}
  <section id="privacy" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-card/40 border border-border/80 p-6 rounded-sm">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-tr-amber">01</span> Privacy Policy
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-3">
      TotalRecalls is built with a local-first, privacy-by-design architecture: it runs entirely on
      your Windows PC, talks directly to the AI providers you already use, and never sees, hosts,
      stores, or transmits your conversations, session tokens, credentials, or downloads.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-[13px]">
      <li><strong>No telemetry in app.</strong> The desktop app has zero telemetry, tracking pixels, or crash reporting. The website sets no cookies; aggregate performance metrics are monitored via privacy-first Cloudflare Web Analytics without cookies or personal profiling.</li>
      <li><strong>Local state only.</strong> Sessions are stored on your PC, encrypted with Windows DPAPI (tied to your Windows user account). You can delete everything at any time.</li>
      <li><strong>One external service: license verification.</strong> When you enter your license key, the app sends the key plus a pseudonymous machine identifier to our own license server at totalrecalls.app — never your content, name, email, or hardware serial. Our checkout processor is not involved in this check. It is best-effort (at most once per hour) and a stored Pro entitlement is never revoked because you are offline.</li>
      <li><strong>Your rights.</strong> Access, correction, and deletion rights under Quebec Law 25, PIPEDA, and the GDPR are addressed in the full policy — most are satisfied by design, since we hold no data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
      <a href="/privacy/" class="text-tr-amber hover:underline font-medium">Read the full Privacy Policy →</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  {/* Section 2: Terms of Service — summary */}
  <section id="terms" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-card/40 border border-border/80 p-6 rounded-sm">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-tr-amber">02</span> Terms of Service
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-3">
      By downloading or using TotalRecalls (including the Free Tier), you agree to the full Terms.
      The essentials:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-[13px]">
      <li><strong>License:</strong> a personal, single-user, non-transferable license to run the Software on up to 3 of your own devices. No redistribution, resale, or reverse engineering.</li>
      <li><strong>Your data is yours:</strong> we claim no ownership of anything you download.</li>
      <li><strong>Provider responsibility:</strong> you are responsible for using your own accounts in line with each provider's terms ({PROVIDERS}). We are not affiliated with any provider.</li>
      <li><strong>Updates vs upgrades:</strong> updates (bug fixes and provider-compatibility fixes) to Downloader Pro are free for the life of the product. Upgrades (new features and add-ons) are separate paid purchases; add-ons you buy receive their own free updates.</li>
      <li><strong>No warranty / limited liability:</strong> the Software is provided "as is"; our aggregate liability is capped at the amount you paid.</li>
      <li><strong>Quebec consumer rights</strong> apply where the law provides, and cannot be waived.</li>
      <li><strong>Governing law:</strong> the Province of Quebec, Canada; exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Montreal.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
      <a href="/terms/" class="text-tr-amber hover:underline font-medium">Read the full Terms of Service →</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  {/* Section 3: Refund Policy */}
  <section id="refund" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-card/40 border border-border/80 p-6 rounded-sm">
    <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-tr-amber">03</span> Refund Policy
    </h2>
    <p class="mb-3">
      TotalRecalls is a one-time purchase — no subscription, no recurring charges.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-[13px]">
      <li><strong>Downloader Pro (one-time purchase).</strong> No refund. The Free Tier is our try-before-you-buy mechanism — you can run a real download on your own chats before paying anything. Your statutory consumer rights are never excluded.</li>
      <li><strong>Smart Search Engine (SSE) add-on:</strong> 7 days, no questions asked. Email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app" class="text-tr-amber hover:underline font-medium">support@totalrecalls.app</a> within 7 days of purchase and we'll refund it &mdash; no form, no reason needed. Your license key is deactivated and the Free Tier remains available.</li>
      <li><strong>Your statutory rights are preserved.</strong> Purchases are processed by our merchant of record, Paddle, who handle payment, invoicing and any applicable sales taxes. Quebec's right of cancellation for online purchases and all applicable consumer protection laws are never excluded or waived by this policy.</li>
      <li><strong>License deactivation = refund.</strong> If a refund is approved, we deactivate your license key and the activation slot is freed. You lose access to Pro features; the Free Tier remains available.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-border/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">
  <span>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app" class="text-tr-amber hover:underline">support@totalrecalls.app</a> · Legal: <a href="mailto:contact@totalrecalls.app" class="text-tr-amber hover:underline">contact@totalrecalls.app</a></span>
  <a href="/" class="hover:text-tr-amber transition-colors">← Back to TotalRecalls Home</a>
</div>

</PageLayout>
